**Keypoints for JTA:**
- Declarative transactions via @Transactional annotations
- Transaction attributes control transaction propagation
- REQUIRED: use existing or create new (default)
- REQUIRES_NEW: always create new, suspend current
- MANDATORY: must have transaction, throw exception if not
- NOT_SUPPORTED: no transaction, suspend current
- NEVER: must not have transaction
- SUPPORTS: flexible, join if exists
- Programmatic control via UserTransaction interface
- Transaction context flows to called methods
- Exception causes automatic rollback
- Savepoints for partial rollback in complex transactions

